# The groupthink section's own. Keys and caches are in the .gitignore one folder up.

# what installing and running the code makes: environments, the problems it downloads, the cache of replies,
# and the folders of new runs (the run of the post is in runs/main/, at the top of this section)
/code/*/.venv/
/code/math_swarm_explore/data/
/code/math_swarm_explore/experiments/*/runs/
